      "role": "remote",
      "text": "For your first visit, it's helpful to bring any recent imaging like X rays or MRIs, plus records from other doctors related to your condition. Also, bring a list of your current medications and your insurance card. If you have any referral paperwork, bring that too. If you have more questions or need details about your appointment, just let me know.",
      "status": "completed",
